Tests for the conveyor firmware

Unit tests run on the PC, not on the ESP32:

- host/tests/      gtest suites, one file per module (*_test.cpp)
- host/fakes/      gMock doubles for every hardware abstraction in include/hal/
- host/include/    fake Arduino core (String, Serial, millis) used for the PC build

Build and run (googletest and ArduinoJson are fetched automatically):

    cmake -S . -B build -DBUILD_TESTS=ON -DBUILD_FIRMWARE=OFF
    cmake --build build
    ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure

See docs/CMAKE_BUILD_TESTS.md for the details.
